                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I don't think anyone will see this review since the game is basically buried and forgotten about with much better games that you can get, but I'll just say this: this game is a very very mediocre indie game with no replay value. There are other games out there that are 3d, for that matter, and with waaaaaaay more work put into them that are free, and yet this dev is still charging $5 for this. This is his only game so far by the way, and it's been about 5 years now and he still hasn't made anything new or even released a patch for this game, so yeah, says a lot about the quality here",
